{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgKdR6uxxF9kZZoQ53PJA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The change that fixed this is commit `c21a7cbf` (\"TRUNK-6683: Skip full-text search with drugs when a concept is provided (#6346)\", by Ian). It adds `concept == null` to the condition that guards the ConceptName full-text lookup in `HibernateConceptDAO.newDrugQuery`. When a concept is supplied, the lookup is skipped and the drug query runs on the drug/concept fields only. Falkon lists the commit under the repository name `github.com/openmrs/openmrs-core`, and the PR number comes from the commit title.\n\nThe fix is in `openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/db/hibernate/HibernateConceptDAO.java`, at lines 1582–1583. The new comment reads \"If a concept is supplied, skip the relatively expensive concept-name full-text search\". Before the change, the guard was only `if (searchDrugConceptNames)`. The concept-name `SearchQueryUnique.findUniqueKeys` call (lines 1584–1590) therefore ran even when a concept was given. Its result only added boosted `concept.conceptId` clauses, so with a concept supplied it was redundant with the existing `concept.conceptId` boost at line 1601.\n\nThe service layer just delegates. `ConceptServiceImpl.getDrugs(...)` at lines 1579–1581 calls `dao.getDrugs(...)` with no logic of its own, so the change is entirely in the DAO. The commit also adds two tests in `HibernateConceptDAOTest` (one that checks the lookup is skipped when a concept is supplied, one that checks it still runs without a concept) and a fixture concept/drug in `HibernateConceptTestDataSet.xml`.\n\nI didn't run the test suite; the evidence above comes from reading the commit diff and the current source.\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/db/hibernate/HibernateConceptDAO.java\", \"startLine\": 1576, \"endLine\": 1593},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/db/hibernate/HibernateConceptDAO.java\", \"startLine\": 1562, \"endLine\": 1572},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/db/hibernate/HibernateConceptDAO.java\", \"startLine\": 1600, \"endLine\": 1603},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/impl/ConceptServiceImpl.java\", \"startLine\": 1579, \"endLine\": 1582},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/test/java/org/openmrs/api/db/hibernate/HibernateConceptDAOTest.java\", \"startLine\": 125, \"endLine\": 157},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/test/resources/org/openmrs/api/db/hibernate/include/HibernateConceptTestDataSet.xml\", \"startLine\": 46, \"endLine\": 49},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/db/ConceptDAO.java\", \"startLine\": 476, \"endLine\": 477},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/ConceptService.java\", \"startLine\": 1686, \"endLine\": 1687},\n  {\"commit\": \"c21a7cbfa2c9f67c1991372a343217e949e04f44\"},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-core\", \"pr\": 6346},\n  {\"ticket\": \"TRUNK-6683\"}\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5313,"cache_read_input_tokens":15962,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5313},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"50a1bc3f-f200-4e5d-b6c4-3b7fff2ee9d7","uuid":"ddc307c4-f46f-4252-9083-d4aee6370fda","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:18:16.842Z","request_id":"req_011CgKdR6ccUbuQYfYkhkBnx"}
